OL,3,AThird of young Brits have never had    
OL,4,Asex, but many are sexting and watching 
OL,5,Aporn                                   
OL,7,FBritish people, particularly teens and 
OL,8,Fyoung adults, are having less or no sex
OL,9,Fcompared to past generations, but lots 
OL,10,Fare watching porn and sexting, a major 
OL,11,Fstudy reveals.                         
OL,13,FIt is the first time The National      
OL,14,FSurvey of Sexual Attitudes and         
OL,15,FLifestyles' (Natsal) research into     
OL,16,Fgeneral public sex lives has asked     
OL,17,Fabout online behaviours.               
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
