PS,C000
CT,25,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Wed 25 NovC03:47/54
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws                 
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIndian government has 'lost the plot', 
OL,4,Asays 'cockroach' leader barred from UK 
OL,5,Aflight                                 
OL,7,FIn an interview with the BBC, Das said 
OL,8,Fthere were no discrepancies in his     
OL,9,Fdocuments, accusing the Indian         
OL,10,Fgovernment of using cheap tactics to   
OL,11,Fstop activists from travelling and     
OL,12,Fspeaking on issues that matter to young
OL,13,Fpeople.                                
OL,15,FThe BBC has reached out to the federal 
OL,16,Fhome ministry, Delhi police and airport
OL,17,Fofficials for comment.                 
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
